{Norman L\u00f3pez Delgado}{mailto:norman.lopez.delgado@gmail.com}]","venue":{"name":"[VID](https:\/\/https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/vid_ibecr\/)","address":"Hatillo 3, contiguo al Liceo Edgar Cervantes","details":"Sal\u00f3n Principal","coordinates":{"latitude":9.917322,"longitude":-84.100223}},"information":"**VID Cubing 2022** \r\n\r\nNuestra prioridad es garantizar la seguridad y el bienestar de nuestros competidores y organizadores durante el desarrollo de la competencia de speedcubing. Por este motivo, es necesario cumplir con todos los protocolos establecidos por el gobierno y las autoridades sanitarias de Costa Rica y por la WCA.\r\n\r\nEl uso de mascarilla es obligatorio en todo momento dentro de la competencia.\r\nSe recomienda llevar m\u00e1s de una mascarilla en caso de ser necesario o bien para hacer un recambio.\r\n_____\r\n**English version**\r\n\r\n**VID Cubing 2022**\r\n\r\nOur priority is to ensure the safety and well-being of our competitors and staff during the development of the speedcubing competition. For this reason, it is necessary to comply with all the protocols established by the government and health authorities of Costa Rica and by the WCA.\r\n\r\nThe use of a mask is mandatory at all times within the competition.\r\nWe reccomend bringing more than one face mask.\r\n\r\n","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"VIDCubing2023","name":"VID Cubing 2023","city":"Hatillo 3, San Jose","country":"CR","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:37","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:37"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333oh","444","minx","pyram","skewb","sq1"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Marvin Solano}{mailto:msolano@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{Norman L\u00f3pez Delgado}{mailto:norman.lopez.delgado@gmail.com}]","venue":{"name":"[VID](https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/vid_ibecr\/)","address":"Hatillo 3, contiguo al Liceo Edgar Cervantes","details":"Sal\u00f3n Principal","coordinates":{"latitude":9.917322,"longitude":-84.100223}},"information":"**VID Cubing 2023** \r\n\r\nEs la segunda competencia del nuevo a\u00f1o 2023.\r\n\r\nEsta competencia es reconocida como una competencia official de la World Cube Association.\r\nLa competencia es abierta a competidores de cualquier nacionalidad, el registro esta habilitado desde la p\u00e1gina oficial de la WCA. No es necesario tener experiencia, pero los competidores deben estar conocer los Reglamentos\r\nEl acceso a invitados y espectadores ser\u00e1 gratuita.\r\n_____\r\n**English version**\r\n\r\n**VID Cubing 2023**\r\n\r\nIs a second competition of the new year 2023. \r\n\r\nThis competition is recognized as an official World Cube Association competition.\r\nThe competition is open to all competitors of all nationalities. Registration is available on the WCA website. No experience in WCA competitions is necessary, but competitors should be familiar with the WCA Regulations\r\nThe competition is free to spectators and guests.\r\n\r\n","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"ViennaBigCubeSummer2023","name":"Vienna Big Cube Summer 2023","city":"Vienna","country":"AT","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:37","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:37"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333oh","444","555","666","777","clock","pyram"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Bence Bar\u00e1t}{mailto:bbarat@worldcubeassociation.org}] [{Viktor Kalmar}{mailto:viktorcube@gmail.com}]","organiser":"[{David Burany}{mailto:d.burany@gmail.com}] [{Felix Strasser}{mailto:felix.strasser@hotmail.com}] [{Florian Truckenthanner}{mailto:vossytv@gmail.com}] [{Lucas H\u00f6glinger}{mailto:lucas.hoeglinger.m@gmail.com}] [{Peter Rois}{mailto:anna.rois70@gmail.com}]","venue":{"name":"[Gro\u00dfer Saal - Pfarre Akkonplatz](https:\/\/www.akkonplatz.at\/index.php\/de\/raeume-nutzen\/grossersaal)","address":"Oeverseestra\u00dfe 2c, 1150 Wien, Austria","details":"Follow the signs to enter the venue.","coordinates":{"latitude":48.202129,"longitude":16.316067}},"information":"##### *English version is below*\r\n\r\n#### **Deutsch:**\r\n\r\nWir freuen uns sehr euch Vienna Big Cube Summer 2023 als ein offizielles WCA Turnier ank\u00fcndigen zu k\u00f6nnen. \r\n\r\nDie Speedcubing Competition wird organisiert von David Burany, Florian Truckenthanner, Felix Strasser, Lucas H\u00f6glinger, Jeremia Neuhold und delegiert von Bence Bar\u00e1t und Viktor Kalmar. Erneut findet das Turnier im gro\u00dfen Saal der Akkonplatz Pfarre statt. Die Resultate dieser Competition werden zu den offiziellen WCA World Rankings hinzugef\u00fcgt.\r\n\r\nJeder ist bei diesem Turnier gerne willkommen, unabh\u00e4ngig von der Erfahrung, Alter oder sonstigen F\u00e4higkeiten. Manche Events haben ein spezifisches Zeitlimit, damit wir sicherstellen k\u00f6nnen den ganzen Tag \u00fcber im Zeitplan zu bleiben. Es d\u00fcrfen Puzzles jeder Marke verwendet werden solange sie den WCA Richtlinien entsprechen. Es sind alle Herzlich willkommen!\r\n\r\nJeder Teilnehmer darf einen Gast mitbringen.\r\n\r\n\r\nWir freuen uns besonders auf neue Speedcuber aus \u00d6sterreich!\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n#### **English:**\r\n\r\nWe are happy to announce the Vienna Big Cube Summer 2023 as an official WCA Competition. \r\n\r\nThe speedcubing competition is organised by David Burany, Florian Truckenthanner, Felix Strasser, Lucas H\u00f6glinger, Jeremia Neuhold and delegated by Bence Bar\u00e1t and Viktor Kalmar. Results of the competition will be added to the official WCA World Rankings.\r\n\r\nThe competition is open to all competitors regardless of experience and skill, but certain event-based time limits will be in place to make sure we can stay on schedule and get through the day on time. No prior experience in WCA competitions is necessary, but competitors must be familiar with the WCA Regulations. Any puzzle brand may be used during the competition, as long as it complies with the WCA regulations.\r\n\r\nEvery Competitor can bring one guest.","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"ViennaCubeDay2019","name":"Vienna Cube Day 2019","city":"Vienna","country":"AT","date":{"from":"2