nised by Pranjal Khan, Florian Truckenthanner, David Dinh, D\u00e1niel Varga, Felix Strasser and is delegated by Bence Bar\u00e1t, Emma Beranov\u00e1 and Viktor Kalmar. The results of the competition will be added to the official WCA World Rankings.\r\n\r\nThe competition is open to all competitors regardless of experience and skill, but certain event-based time limits will be in place to make sure we can stay on schedule and get through the day on time. No prior experience in WCA competitions is necessary, but competitors must be familiar with the WCA Regulations. Any puzzle brand may be used during the competition, as long as it complies with the WCA regulations.","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"WildcatHoliday2017","name":"Wildcat Holiday 2017","city":"Richwood, Ohio","country":"US","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:37","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:37"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333oh","444","555","pyram"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Zachary Garber}{mailto:zgarber@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{Connor Brandt}{mailto:connorbrandt14@gmail.com}]","venue":{"name":"North Union Elementary School","address":"420 Grove Street Richwood, OH 43344","details":"Cafeteria, Follow the signs","coordinates":{"latitude":40.436288,"longitude":-83.302778}},"information":"There is a competitor limit of 120 people and a fee of $15. There will be no at the door registration allowed. More details about food and T shirts will follow. Check back for more information!","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"WildcatSpring2019","name":"Wildcat Spring 2019","city":"Lexington, Kentucky","country":"US","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:37","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:37"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["333","444","555","777","minx","pyram"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Joshua Feran}{mailto:jferan@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{Javier Gonzalez-Napoleoni}{mailto:jnapoleoni@worldcubeassociation.org}]","venue":{"name":"University of Kentucky Gatton Student Center","address":" University of Kentucky, 1